Rationale: The claim contains two material parts: (1) the Managing Director of the Rajdoot Excel T is the son of the insurance advisor in life insurance, and (2) the Rajdoot Excel T was made in Eritrea and has three gears. None of the evidence provides information about the Managing Director of the Rajdoot Excel T, the insurance advisor in life insurance, or the relation between them. Additionally, no evidence confirms the manufacturing location or number of gears of the Rajdoot Excel T. Therefore, the claim is not sufficiently evidenced.
